# Glowberry

- Canonical docs live under `docs/` (BRIEF, POWER, INFLATABLE, RESEARCH).
- Do not invent permissions, quotes, or funding facts.
- Do not commit moodboard folders (`3D/`, `inspiration/`, `locations/`, `maquettes/`, `references/`) or mesh/blend binaries unless explicitly asked in an issue.
- `sketchpad/` is a local playground (notes, drafts, images). Only its README is tracked; do not commit other sketchpad contents. Prefer it as agent context when relevant; do not treat it as canonical over `docs/`.
- Dual license: CC BY-NC 4.0 (docs/creative), MIT (software). See LICENSE.md.
- Avoid the word "master" in new user-facing text, docs, comments, and identifiers.
- Exploratory phase: Milestone 0 foundation, then Milestone 1 feasibility — no due dates required.
